# Dokku provider

The Dokku provider manages a [Dokku](https://dokku.com) server. It is built on the [docket](https://github.com/dokku/docket) SDK: every resource and data source is one docket task type, and its attributes, defaults, constraints and documentation come from docket's task catalog.

